<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 171 0 R
/E (     We are the Knights of Ni, a robotics team associated with the Stanford Online High School \(OHS\), with team members around the world. We were founded in the 2011-12 season and have excelled ever since, even qualifying for the Houston World Championship in 2015. This year, we believe that we have accomplished our goals of building technical knowledge, empowering our community, and building a unique and innovative robot.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
