<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (     As an online team spread across the world, our team sought to engage in virtual and sustainable solutions to gaps in our respective communities around the globe. We planned outreach events at the intersection of FIRST values and robotics education. We also epitomized Gracious Professionalism on and off the field by mentoring other FIRST robotics teams to make robotics more accessible. Overall, our outreach efforts impacted dozens of students. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
