/E (     We created a publicly accessible website with a comprehensive set of Fusion360 tutorials. This website was shared by the NorCal FTC on their website, the NorCal FTC Teams Helping Teams Resource Page. Our tutorials draw upon our personal experiences working in FTC. They aim to combat the deficits in mentorship through step-by-step guides and challenge problems that both rookie and veteran teams can take advantage of.)
/Pg 15 0 R
