/E (     At Stanford Online High School, half of our team members are peer tutors and/or teaching assistants, including Aanya, Rachael, Aryaman, Alexander, and Maxwell. Peer tutors and teaching assistants are selected at the completion of the previous school year, having exemplified the OHS values of academic achievement and service to the school community. They commit at least two hours per week of appointments, as well as hosting weekly office hours and exam review sessions. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [11]
